<title>UK: Trade slow on UK meals and feeds market.</title>
<headline>Trade slow on UK meals and feeds market.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Business was slow on the UK meals and feeds market on Friday despite lower prices.</p>
<p>High protein soymeal was around one stg down, but no business was reported.</p>
<p>&quot;I'm sure business is going on, but people don't want it reported,&quot; said one trader.</p>
<p>In the Avon area Argentine cottonseed extraction traded at 128 stg for spot delivery.</p>
<p>--Jim Ballantyne, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8062</p>
